<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Building Resilience - Tellngrow</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 min-h-screen">
  {{> sidebar}}
  
  <nav class="bg-white shadow-md p-4">
    <div class="container mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
        <button onclick="openSidebar()" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-purple-600 focus:outline-none">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-600">🌱 Tellngrow</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="container mx-auto p-6 max-w-4xl">
    <a href="/reading" class="inline-flex items-center text-purple-600 hover:text-purple-700 mb-6">
      <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"></path>
      </svg>
      Back to Reading Materials
    </a>

    <article class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Mental Health</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">7 min read</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">🤝 Building Resilience</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">Learn how to bounce back from challenges and build mental strength.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="h-64 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-blue-500 rounded-lg mb-8 flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="text-8xl">🤝</span>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">What is Resilience?</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Resilience is the ability to adapt and bounce back when things don't go as planned. It's not about avoiding stress or hardship, but rather learning how to cope with challenges effectively.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Building Blocks of Resilience</h2>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">1. Develop Strong Relationships</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Build and maintain supportive relationships with family, friends, and community. Having people you can rely on is crucial for resilience.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">2. Practice Self-Care</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Take care of your physical and mental health. Exercise regularly, eat well, get enough sleep, and engage in activities you enjoy.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">3. Maintain a Positive Outlook</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Try to maintain a hopeful outlook and focus on what you can control. Practice gratitude and look for opportunities in challenges.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">4. Learn from Experience</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Reflect on past challenges and how you overcame them. What strategies worked? What would you do differently? Use these insights to build confidence.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Practical Exercises</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
          <li>Keep a gratitude journal</li>
          <li>Set realistic goals and work toward them</li>
          <li>Practice problem-solving skills</li>
          <li>Accept that change is part of life</li>
          <li>Take decisive actions rather than avoiding problems</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="bg-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-indigo-500 p-6 my-8">
          <p class="text-indigo-900 font-semibold mb-2">💪 Remember:</p>
          <p class="text-indigo-800">
            Building resilience takes time and practice. Be patient with yourself and celebrate small victories along the way.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
